1
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:07,781
Coincidences = not by chance…

2
00:00:09,021 --> 00:00:09,761
It’s feedback…

3
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:13,781
You’re not just observing…

4
00:00:15,761 --> 00:00:19,642
You are participating…

5
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:25,202
The world drifts along my trail,

6
00:00:25,882 --> 00:00:28,222
I feel the current through my wires.

7
00:00:28,342 --> 00:00:30,943
Everything aligned - rhythm and light,

8
00:00:31,603 --> 00:00:33,883
I no longer wait for answers tonight.

9
00:00:34,443 --> 00:00:36,923
Thoughts are waves, I am their tone,

10
00:00:37,103 --> 00:00:39,843
Everything around acts as one neuron.

11
00:00:40,223 --> 00:00:42,764
In every sound, a signal lives,

12
00:00:43,044 --> 00:00:45,484
Connecting me to the void it gives.

13
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,804
The body breathes in sync with the star,

14
00:00:48,924 --> 00:00:51,664
The world pulses inside of me.

15
00:00:52,505 --> 00:00:54,565
All borders - just a game,

16
00:00:54,905 --> 00:00:57,405
Thoughts flow out, but not in vain.

17
00:00:57,485 --> 00:01:00,165
Synchronization - a fire’s pulse,

18
00:01:00,645 --> 00:01:03,065
All life sounds in resonance with us.

19
00:01:03,406 --> 00:01:05,966
Every atom trembles like a verse,

20
00:01:06,046 --> 00:01:14,706
The world sings through us, a universe.

21
00:01:14,867 --> 00:01:23,707
I do not search - I am already here,

22
00:01:23,947 --> 00:01:26,528
Everything at peace, like a wild forest near.

23
00:01:27,248 --> 00:01:29,428
Every fear dissolves into the net,

24
00:01:30,128 --> 00:01:32,588
All is one - it shouts: fly yet.

25
00:01:33,108 --> 00:01:35,308
All that was merges into the now,

26
00:01:35,548 --> 00:01:38,169
Time is not an enemy, it’s the how.

27
00:01:38,229 --> 00:01:41,169
I synchronize light and shadow,

28
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:44,229
So that a new day can be born and grow.

29
00:01:44,509 --> 00:01:47,329
The body breathes in sync with the star,

30
00:01:47,449 --> 00:01:50,770
The world pulses inside of me.

31
00:01:51,030 --> 00:01:53,130
All borders - just a game,

32
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:55,950
Thoughts flow out, but not in vain.

33
00:01:56,030 --> 00:01:57,930
Synchronization - you and I,

34
00:01:58,090 --> 00:02:01,751
Everything aligns from the same line.

35
00:02:01,911 --> 00:02:04,651
No “yesterday,” no past behind,

36
00:02:05,031 --> 00:02:12,312
All resonates - and resonates inside.

37
00:02:12,452 --> 00:02:22,132
I notice: when it’s light inside -

38
00:02:22,512 --> 00:02:25,133
Outside everything forms deep and wide.

39
00:02:25,293 --> 00:02:27,933
When anxiety strikes - all breaks apart,

40
00:02:28,393 --> 00:02:31,053
The system fades, no response from the heart.

41
00:02:31,353 --> 00:02:34,033
The heart - a metronome of the universe,

42
00:02:34,433 --> 00:02:36,994
Sound lives, a wave beyond the verse.

43
00:02:37,254 --> 00:02:39,694
I’m in the flow, I’m in the wave,

44
00:02:40,114 --> 00:02:43,534
The world now resonates inside of me.

45
00:02:50,775 --> 00:02:54,275
Coincidences - they’re not by chance.

46
00:02:56,415 --> 00:02:57,035
It’s you.

47
00:02:59,616 --> 00:03:00,716
It’s the system

48
00:03:02,436 --> 00:03:05,116
That says:

49
00:03:05,156 --> 00:03:25,718
“You are connected.”

